%% Flow - recruiter page generation
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Trig as Trigger
  participant CI as Actions Generate Pipeline
  participant Ev as Evidence Selector
  participant Ctr as GenerateRecruiterPage Contract
  participant Rt as Model Router
  participant AI as AI Provider
  participant Val as Evidence Grounding Validator
  participant GH as GitHub
  participant Rev as Reviewer

  Trig->>CI: manual dispatch or scheduled refresh
  CI->>Ev: select allowed evidence
  Ev->>Ev: canonical docs named in contract
  Ev->>Ev: repo facts - commits - languages - test counts
  Ev-->>CI: evidence bundle with source hashes
  CI->>Ctr: load contract inputs schema and gates
  Ctr-->>CI: prompt template and output schema
  CI->>Rt: route recruiter task per config policy
  Rt->>AI: completion call with delimited evidence only
  AI-->>Rt: draft recruiter page
  Rt-->>CI: parsed structured output
  CI->>Val: check every claim maps to evidence
  Val->>Val: reject claims without source citation
  Val-->>CI: grounding report
  CI->>GH: stamp provenance and open PR on docs-gen branch
  GH->>Rev: request human approval
  Rev->>GH: approve and merge to publish
